<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', {title, meta, og, twitter, schema, canonical, trackingId}) %>
<body>

<div id="dw-preloader">
  <div class="dw-preloader-bar"></div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="dw-container">
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="breadcrumb-dw">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <span>Services</span>
      </div>
      <span class="section-label">What We Do</span>
      <h1>Build Scalable Products<br>with Expert Engineering</h1>
      <p class="section-sub mx-auto">
        We specialise in a focused set of services where senior engineering and
        AI-enhanced workflows deliver the best outcomes for your business.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Services Detail -->
<section class="dw-section">
  <div class="dw-container">
    <div class="service-detail-grid">

      <div class="svc-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon" style="margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.4rem;width:52px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px">&#127760;</div>
        <h3>Custom Web Portals</h3>
        <p>B2B dashboards, client-facing portals, admin systems, and internal tools. We build with React or Next.js, design for performance and usability, and architect for data scale. Ideal for companies replacing spreadsheets, legacy tools, or needing a custom operations layer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-card reveal reveal-d1">
        <div class="service-icon" style="margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.4rem;width:52px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px">&#128722;</div>
        <h3>Shopify App Development</h3>
        <p>Custom Shopify apps, embedded admin apps, theme extensions, and Shopify Hydrogen storefronts. We've shipped our own Shopify app (Customer Story), so we understand the platform deeply, including the Shopify API, webhooks, billing, and review lifecycle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-card reveal reveal-d2">
        <div class="service-icon" style="margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.4rem;width:52px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px">&#128640;</div>
        <h3>SaaS Product Engineering</h3>
        <p>Full-stack product builds from zero to launch, or from MVP to scale. We handle architecture, API design, authentication, database schema, background jobs, and deployment. Node.js, Prisma, Supabase, and modern React on the frontend.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-card reveal reveal-d1" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(108,71,255,.07),rgba(0,212,200,.04));border-color:rgba(108,71,255,.3);position:relative">
        <span class="service-badge">&#9889; New</span>
        <div class="service-icon" style="margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.4rem;width:52px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(108,71,255,.15);border:1px solid rgba(108,71,255,.3);border-radius:12px">&#129302;</div>
        <h3>AI-Enhanced Development</h3>
        <p>We use Cursor and Claude in our engineering workflow as force multipliers, enabling faster iteration cycles without sacrificing code quality or architectural integrity. You get the same senior-quality output in significantly less time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-card reveal reveal-d2">
        <div class="service-icon" style="margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.4rem;width:52px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px">&#128260;</div>
        <h3>Legacy Modernization</h3>
        <p>Rescue and re-architect aging codebases. We audit your existing system, identify bottlenecks, and modernize incrementally, improving performance, security, and developer experience without requiring a full rewrite from day one.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Tech Stack -->
<section class="dw-section" style="background:var(--surface);padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px">
  <div class="dw-container">
    <span class="section-label reveal">Technology</span>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Our Tech Stack</h2>
    <p class="section-sub reveal reveal-d2">
      We work with modern, battle-tested technologies, chosen for each project based on
      what will serve you best long-term.
    </p>
    <div class="tech-grid">
      <span class="tech-pill reveal">&#9679; Node.js</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9679; React</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d2">&#9679; Next.js</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9679; Angular</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d2">&#9679; PHP / Laravel</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9679; Shopify API</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d2">&#9679; Prisma ORM</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9679; Supabase</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d2">&#9679; PostgreSQL</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9679; MongoDB</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d2">&#9679; REST &amp; GraphQL</span>
      <span class="tech-pill reveal reveal-d1">&#9889; Cursor + Claude</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Process -->
<section class="dw-section">
  <div class="dw-container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <span class="section-label reveal">How We Work</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Our process,<br>start to finish.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub reveal reveal-d2">
          A repeatable, transparent process that keeps projects on time
          and on budget, without surprises.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="process-steps">

          <div class="process-step reveal">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h4>Discovery &amp; Scoping</h4>
              <p>We understand your goals, constraints, and users. We define the problem clearly before touching any code. Output: a scoped proposal and project roadmap.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step reveal reveal-d1">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h4>Architecture &amp; Design</h4>
              <p>We design system architecture, data models, and UI flows. AI-assisted design sprints mean you see screens faster, without skipping the thinking.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step reveal reveal-d2">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h4>Engineering</h4>
              <p>Senior engineers build with Cursor + Claude as productivity tools. Weekly demos. Clean git history. No surprises in the final handoff.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step reveal reveal-d3">
            <div class="step-num">04</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h4>Launch &amp; Support</h4>
              <p>Deployment, monitoring setup, documentation, and a structured handoff. Post-launch support included for 30 days at no extra charge.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section dw-section">
  <div class="dw-container">
    <span class="section-label" style="justify-content:center">Start a Conversation</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">Have a project in mind?</h2>
    <p class="reveal reveal-d1">Tell us what you're building and we'll come back with a plan.</p>
    <div class="cta-btns reveal reveal-d2">
      <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-primary btn-lg">Start a Project</a>
      <a href="/lets-talk" class="btn-outline btn-lg">Book a Call</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer', { recent_blogs: recent_blogs }) %>
<script src="/js/dadword.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
